{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-278",
  "title": "sam.gov API docs",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "sam.gov API docs"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Get Opportunities API provides all the published opportunity details based on the request parameters. This API requires pagination, and the response will be provided to users synchronously."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**This API only provides the latest active version of the opportunity. To view all version of the opportunity, please visit Data Services Section of SAM.gov. All active notices in SAM.gov are updated daily and all archived notices are updated on a weekly basis.**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "[Active Opportunities](https://sam.gov/data-services?domain=Contract%20Opportunities%2Fdatagov)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "[Archived Opportunities](https://sam.gov/data-services?domain=Contract%20Opportunities%2FArchived%20Data)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Get Opportunities API can be accessed from Production or Alpha via the following environments:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Version Control - v2**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-8",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Production:https://api.sam.gov/opportunities/v2/search"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-9",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Alpha:https://api-alpha.sam.gov/opportunities/v2/search"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "User of this public API must provide an API key to use this Opportunities public API. Request per day are limited based on the federal or non-federal or general roles. Note: User can request a public API Key in the Account Details page on SAM.gov (if testing in production) Else on alpha.sam.gov (if testing in prodlike)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**User Account API Key Creation**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-13",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Registered user can request for a public API on ‘Account Details’ page. This page can be accessed on Account Details page on SAM.gov"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-14",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "User must enter account password on ‘Account Details’ page to view the API Key information. If an incorrect password is entered, an error will be returned."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-15",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "After the API Key is generated on ‘Account Details’ page, the API Key can be viewed on the Account Details page immediately. The API Key is visible until user navigates to a different page."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-16",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "If an error is encountered during the API Key generation/retrieval, then user will receive an error message and must try again."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Users can search by any of the below request parameters with Date field as mandatory."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Request Parameters that API accepts** | **Description** | **Required** | **Data Type** | **Applicable Versions** |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| api_key | Public Key of users | Yes | String | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| ptype | Procurement Type. Below are the available Procurement Types:u= Justification (J&A)p = Pre solicitationa = Award Noticer = Sources Soughts = Special Noticeo = Solicitationg = Sale of Surplus Propertyk = Combined Synopsis/Solicitationi = Intent to Bundle Requirements (DoD-Funded)Note: Below services are now retired:f = Foreign Government Standardl = Fair Opportunity / Limited SourcesUse Justification (u) instead of fair Opportunity | No | String | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| solnum | Solicitation Number | No | String | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| noticeid | Notice ID | No | String | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| title | Title | No | String | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| postedFrom | Posted date FromFormat must be MM/dd/yyyyNote: Date range between Posted Date From and To is 1 year | Yes | String | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| postedTo | Posted date To Format must be MM/dd/yyyyNote: Date range between Posted Date From and To is 1 year | Yes | String | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| deptname | Department Name (L1) | No | String | v2 - Deprecated |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| subtier | Agency Name (L2) | No | String | v2 - Deprecated |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| state | Place of Performance (State) | No | String | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| status (Coming Soon) | Status of the opportunityAccepts following: active, inactive, archived, cancelled, deleted | No | String | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| zip | Place of Performance (Zip code) | No | String | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| organizationCode | Code of associated organization | No | string | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| organizationName | Name of associated organization. This Request Parameter can be used to filter the dataset by Department Name or Subtier Name*Note: General Search can be performed* | No | String | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-35",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| typeOfSetAside | [Refer Set-Aside Value Section](https://open.gsa.gov/api/get-opportunities-public-api/#set-aside-values) | No | String | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| typeOfSetAsideDescription | Set Aside code Description. See above descriptions mentioned against each of the Set Aside Code | No | String | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-37",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| ncode | NAICS Code. This code is maximum of 6 digits | No | String | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| ccode | Classification Code | No | String | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| rdlfrom | Response Deadline date. Format must be MM/dd/yyyyNote: If response date From & To is provided, then the date range is 1 year | No | String | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| rdlto | Response Deadline date. Format must be MM/dd/yyyyNote: If response date From & To is provided, then the date range is 1 year | No | String | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-41",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| limit | Total number of records to be retrieved per page. This field must be a numberMax Value = 1000. Default limit value is 1. | No | Int | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-42",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| offset | Indicates the page index. Default offset starts with 0 | No | Int | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Based on the request parameters, API provides below response parameters."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Request Parameters that API accepts** | **Description** | **Data Type** | **Applicable Versions** |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-45",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| --- | --- | --- | --- |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-46",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| totalRecords | Total number of records for the search | Number | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-47",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| limit | Limit entered by a user while making the request i.e. total number of records that user wished to retrieve per page | Number | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| offset | Page index specified by a user. Default offset starts with 0 if user does not provide any offset in the request | Number | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| title | Opportunity Title | String | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| solicitationNumber | Solicitation Number | String | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| fullParentPathName | Names of all organizations notice is associated with | String | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-52",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| fullParentPathCode | Codes of all organizations notice is associated with | String | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-53",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| department | Department (L1) | String | v2 - Deprecated |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-54",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| subtier | Sub-Tier (L2) | String | v2 - Deprecated |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-55",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| office | Office (L3) | String | v2 - Deprecated |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-56",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| postedDate | Opportunity Posted DateYYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS | String | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-57",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| type | Opportunity current type | String | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-58",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| baseType | Opportunity original type | String | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-59",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| archiveType | Archive Type | String | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-60",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| archiveDate | Archived Date | String | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-61",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| setAside | Set Aside Description | String | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-62",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| setAsideCode | Set Aside Code | String | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-63",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| reponseDeadLine | Response Deadline Date | String | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-64",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| naicsCode | NAICS Code. This code is maximum of 6 digits | String | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-65",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| classificationCode | Classification Code | String | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-66",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| active | If Active = Yes, then the opportunity is active, if No, then opportunity is Archived | String | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-67",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| data.award | Award Information (If Available):Award amountAwardeeAward dateAward Number | JSON Object | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-68",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| data.award.number | Award Number | String | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-69",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| data.award.amount | Award Amount | Number | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-70",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| data.award.date | Award Date | Date and Time | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-71",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| data.award.awardee | NameLocationueiSAM | JSON Object | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-72",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| data.award.awardee.name | Awardee Name | String | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-73",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| data.award.awardee.ueiSAM | Unique Entity Identifier SAM - Allow 12 digit value, alphanumericExample: ueiSAM=025114695AST | String | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-74",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| data.award.awardee.location.streetAddress | Awardee Street Address 1 | String | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
