    {
      "id": "b-115",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| uiLink | Direct UI link to the opportunity. To view the opportunity on UI, user must have either a contracting officer or a Contracting Specialist role. If user hits the link without logging in, user is directed to 404 not found page | String | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-116",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| links | Every record in a response has this links array consisting of:rel: selfhref: link to the specific opportunity itself. User should provide an API key to access the opportunity directlyAlso, every response has a master links array consisting of:rel: selfhref: link to the actual request. User should provide an API key to access the request | Array | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-117",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| resourceLinks | Direct URL to download attachments in the opportunity | Array of Strings | v2 |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-118",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Set-Aside Values**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-119",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Several methods pertaining to submitting Contract Opportunities involve the Set-Aside Type field. Use the Set-Aside codes to submit notices."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-120",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Only one Set-Aside value is accepted in the field at this time"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-121",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Refer below table for valid Set-Aside values:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-122",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Code** | **SetAside Values** |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-123",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| --- | --- |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-124",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| SBA | Total Small Business Set-Aside (FAR 19.5) |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-125",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| SBP | Partial Small Business Set-Aside (FAR 19.5) |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-126",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| 8A | 8(a) Set-Aside (FAR 19.8) |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-127",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| 8AN | 8(a) Sole Source (FAR 19.8) |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-128",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| HZC | Historically Underutilized Business (HUBZone) Set-Aside (FAR 19.13) |"
        }
      ]
    },
