    {
      "id": "b-166",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| For limit, user provides range beyond 1000. | Limit valid range is 0-1000. Please provide valid input. |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-167",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| For limit or offset, user inputs characters/special characters. | limit/offset must be a positive number. |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-168",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| For postedFrom, postedTo, rdlfrom, rdlto user enters an invalid date format. | Invalid Date Entered. Expected date format is MM/dd/yyyy |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-169",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| User does not provide postedFrom and postedTo values. | PostedFrom and PostedTo are mandatory |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-170",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| User provides more than 1 year of date range for postedFrom and postedToORUser provides more than 1 year of date range for rdlfrom and rdlto | Date range must be 1 year(s) apart |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-171",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| User provides invalid API Key | An invalid api_key was supplied |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-172",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| User does not provide any API key | No api_key was supplied |"
        }
      ]
    },
